{"id": "places/endless-tower", "type": "places", "slug": "endless-tower", "title": "Endless Tower", "summary": "The tower rising over the north of the city, entered on foot from its plaza.", "rarity": null, "is_overview": false, "image": "/games/overrank/places/endless-tower-512.webp", "infobox": [{"key": "Features", "value": "the tower board, entry tickets, checkpoints", "html": "<dd>the tower board, entry tickets, checkpoints</dd>"}], "sections": [{"id": "overview", "heading": "Overview", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "The tower rising over the north of the city, entered on foot from its plaza. Endless floors played solo: a boss every 25 floors, a checkpoint every 25, a new arena style every 100 floors (Marble Sanctum, Frozen Spire, Infernal Forge, Celestial Court, Void Throne). Entry tickets: 1 free a day, then shards or Robux. The top 3 of its board keep their rewards while they stay there.", "html": "<p>The tower rising over the north of the city, entered on foot from its plaza. Endless floors played solo: a boss every 25 floors, a checkpoint every 25, a new arena style every 100 floors (Marble Sanctum, Frozen Spire, Infernal Forge, Celestial Court, Void Throne). Entry tickets: 1 free a day, then shards or Robux. The top 3 of its board keep their rewards while they stay there.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "", "html": "<p><img alt=\"Endless Tower in the game\" src=\"/games/overrank/places/endless-tower.webp\"/></p>"}]}, {"id": "what-you-find-here", "heading": "What you find here", "blocks": [{"type": "ul", "text": "The tower board Entry tickets Checkpoints", "html": "<ul> <li>The tower board</li> <li>Entry tickets</li> <li>Checkpoints</li> </ul>"}]}, {"id": "arena-styles", "heading": "Arena styles", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "A run's arena changes style every 100 floors (after the fifth, the styles start over):", "html": "<p>A run's arena changes style every 100 floors (after the fifth, the styles start over):</p>"}, {"type": "table", "headers": ["Floo